{"id":"n5-083","title":"そして、～ (soshite、～)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Used to connect two sentences; 'and then', 'and'.","longExplanation":"The そして grammar point is used to connect two sentences or ideas, expressing a sequence of events or actions. It is commonly translated to 'and then' or simply 'and' in English.","formation":"Sentence 1 + そして + Sentence 2","examples":[{"jp":"朝起きて、そして宿題をしました。","romaji":"Asa okite, soshite shukudai wo shimashita.","en":"I woke up in the morning and then did my homework.","words":[{"surface":"朝","vocabId":"1428280","reading":"あさ"},{"surface":"起き","vocabId":"1223640","reading":"おきる","baseForm":"起きる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"そして","vocabId":null},{"surface":"宿題","vocabId":"1337270","reading":"しゅくだい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4]},{"jp":"コーヒーを飲んで、そして新聞を読みました。","romaji":"Koohii wo nonde, soshite shinbun wo yomimashita.","en":"I drank coffee and then read the newspaper.","words":[{"surface":"コーヒー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"飲ん","vocabId":"1169870","reading":"のむ","baseForm":"飲む"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"そして","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新聞","vocabId":"1362360","reading":"しんぶん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"読み","vocabId":"1456130","reading":"よみ","baseForm":"読む"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"家を出発しました。そして、駅へ行きました。","romaji":"Ie wo shuppatsu shimashita. Soshite, eki e ikimashita.","en":"I left my house and then went to the station.","words":[{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出発","vocabId":"1340000","reading":"しゅっぱつ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"そして","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"駅","vocabId":"1175140","reading":"えき"},{"surface":"へ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"彼はゲームをした。そして、テレビを見ました。","romaji":"Kare wa geemu wo shita. Soshite, terebi wo mimashita.","en":"He played games and then watched TV.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゲーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"そして","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"テレビ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"The standard connector for sequential sentences - \"and/and then\"; common in writing too.","family":{"id":"sequence-then","name":"Sequence (And Then)","relatedPoints":["n5-085","n2-011","n5-006","n4-122","n5-004"]}}